                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#DifferentialOfMinimalTrivalenVacuumGraph"}
            %center
              %img{:src => "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/files/The3TermRelationInTheKnotGraphComplexII.jpg", :width => "680"}/
            %p
              Notice how the edges parallel to the outer dashed arcs do not make the graphs in the first line vanish, but the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/parallel+edges"} parallel edges
