                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mn 3
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} KnotGraphs(\mathbb{R}^3)
              consisting of just two overlapping chords gets contributions only from contraction of the four arcs:
            %center
              %img{:src => "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/files/Diff2ChordsDiagramInKnotGraphs.jpg", :width => "720"}/
