                = succeed ":555-575," do
                  %strong 59
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0701825"} arxiv/0701825
          %h3#as_construction_of_higher_order_vassiliev_invariants As construction of higher order Vassiliev invariants
          %p
            Discussion of the graph complex as computing higher order
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vassiliev+invariants"} Vassiliev invariants
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/real+cohomology"} real cohomology
            of spaces of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/knots"} knots
            (with the cohomology in degree-0 being the ordinary
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vassiliev+invariants"} Vassiliev invariants
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "#Kontsevich93"} Kontsevich 93, Section 5
            %li
              %p
                Daniel Altschuler, Laurent Freidel,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Vassiliev knot invariants and Chern-Simons perturbation theory to all orders
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/q-alg/9603010"} arxiv:q-alg/9603010
            %li#CattaneoCottaRamusinoLongoni02
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alberto+Cattaneo"}> Alberto Cattaneo
                , Paolo Cotta-Ramusino, Riccardo Longoni,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Configuration spaces and Vassiliev classes in any dimension
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/9910139"} arXiv:math/9910139
            %li#CattaneoCottaRamusinoLongoni05
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alberto+Cattaneo"}> Alberto Cattaneo
                , Paolo Cotta-Ramusino, Riccardo Longoni,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Algebraic structures on graph cohomology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0307218"} arXiv:math/0307218
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1142/S0218216505004019"} doi:10.1142/S0218216505004019
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0307218"} math.GT/0307218
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=2006g:58021"} MR2006g:58021
            %li#GuadagniniMartelliniMintchev89
              %p
                E. Guadagnini, E. Martellini, M. Mintchev,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Chern-Simons field theory and link invariants
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Knots, Topology and QuantumField Theories
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/9789814540742"} doi:10.1142/9789814540742
            %li#BarNatan91
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dror+Bar-Natan"}> Dror Bar-Natan
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Perturbative aspects of the Chern-Simons topological quantum field theory
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/323500"} spire:323500
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://search.proquest.com/docview/303979053"} proquest:303979053
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/BarNatanPerturbativeCS91.pdf", :title => ""} BarNatanPerturbativeCS91.pdf
          %p Reviewed in:
          %ul
            %li#Volic13
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ismar+Voli%C4%87"}> Ismar Volić
              , Section 4 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Configuration space integrals and the topology of knot and link spaces
              %a{:href => "https://fdocuments.co/amp/document/morfismos-vol-17-no-2-2013.html"} Morfismos, Vol 17, no 2, 2013
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1310.7224"}> arxiv:1310.7224
              )
          %h3#coproduct Coproduct
          %p
            Discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coproducts"} coproducts
            on a graph complex, given by decomposition of graphs into subgraphs and contractions of subgraphs:
          %ul
            %li#Ionescu03
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lucian+Ionescu"}> Lucian Ionescu
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Perturbative Quantum Field Theory and Configuration Space Integrals
                %em Advances in Topological Quantum Field Theory
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0307062"}> arXiv:hep-th/0307062
                ,
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-1-4020-2772-7"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4020-2772-7
            %li#Ionescu05
              %p
