              )
          %p
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi H
                    %mn 0
                  %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} (
                  %msub
                    %mi Graphs
                    %mn 0
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %msup
                    %mi ℝ
                    %mn 2
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H^0\big( Graphs_0(\mathbb{R}^2) \big)
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+algebra"} Lie algebra
            of the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Grothendieck-Teichm%C3%BCller+group"} Grothendieck-Teichmüller group
          %ul
            %li#Willwacher10
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thomas+Willwacher"}> Thomas Willwacher
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em M. Kontsevich’s graph complex and the Grothendieck-Teichmueller Lie algebra
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1009.1654"} arxiv:1009.1654
            %li#DolgushevRogers12
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vasily+Dolgushev"}> Vasily Dolgushev
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Christopher+Rogers"} Christopher Rogers
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Notes on Algebraic Operads, Graph Complexes, and Willwacher’s Construction
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1202.2937"} arXiv:1202.2937
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vasily+Dolgushev"}> Vasily Dolgushev
                ,
                %em A manifestation of the Grothendieck-Teichmuellergroup in geometry
                (
                %a{:href => "https://math.temple.edu/~vald/AMSslides.pdf"}> slides pdf
                )
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              Kevin Morand,
              %em A note on multi-oriented graph complexes and deformation quantization of Lie bialgebroids
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2102.07593"}> arXiv:2102.07593
              )
          %p More:
          %ul
            %li#KoroshkinWillwacherZivkovic14
              Anton Khoroshkin,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thomas+Willwacher"} Thomas Willwacher
              %em Differentials on graph complexes
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1411.2369"}> arXiv:1411.2369
              )
          %h3#more More
          %p
